The Age- and Generation-Based Metastatic Cancer Model MATLAB Software (the
"Software") is a software program used to implement and numerically investigate
the mathematical model described in:

Gavriliadis, P., Lolas, G., and Matsoukas, T. (2026).
"Age and generation-based model of metastatic cancer: From micrometastases to
macrometastases." Journal of Theoretical Biology, 623, 112392.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2026.112392

The Software is made available by inCELLia through the Licensor identified
above.

